  "shiftTabFocus": "<body>\n<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>\n<div class=\"app-shell\">\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\" aria-label=\"주 메뉴\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"desktop.html\" aria-label=\"SYNK WORLD 홈\"><img src=\"assets/logo.webp\" alt=\"synk\" width=\"104\" height=\"50\"><span>WORLD</span></a>\n    <p class=\"nav-eyebrow\">나의 작은 세계</p>\n    <nav class=\"side-links\">\n      <button data-nav=\"home\" class=\"nav-item\"><span data-icon=\"home\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10.5 12 3l9 7.5M5.5 9v11h5v-6h3v6h5V9\"></path></svg></span><span>홈</span></button>\n      <button data-nav=\"games\" class=\"nav-item\"><span data-icon=\"game\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10c2 0 3 2 3.5 4l1 6c.4 3-2 4-4 2l-2-2h-7l-2 2c-2 2-4.4 1-4-2l1-6C4 9 5 7 7 7ZM6 11v5m-2.5-2.5h5m7-2h.1m2 3h.1\"></path></svg></span><span>미니게임</span></button>\n      <button data-nav=\"wardrobe\" class=\"nav-item is-active\" aria-current=\"page\"><span data-icon=\"hanger\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 6a2 2 0 1 1 4 0c0 2-2 2-2 4l9 6v3H3v-3l9-6\"></path></svg></span><span>나의 옷장</span></button>\n      <button data-nav=\"town\" class=\"nav-item\"><span data-icon=\"town\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 21V9l6-4 6 4v12M6 11h1m4 0h1m-6 4h1m4 0h1m4-8 6 3v11H3m6-3v3m9-8h1m-1 4h1\"></path></svg></span><span>싱크 타운</span></button>\n      <button data-nav=\"songs\" class=\"nav-item\"><span data-icon=\"music\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 18V5l11-2v13M9 8l11-2M9 18c0 2-2 3-4 3s-3-1-3-2 2-3 4-3 3 1 3 2Zm11-2c0 2-2 3-4 3s-3-1-3-2 2-3 4-3 3 1 3 2Z\"></path></svg></span><span>노래로 배우기</span></button>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-bottom\"><button class=\"nav-item\" data-action=\"settings\"><span data-icon=\"settings\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8ZM9 3h6l1 3 3 1 2 5-2 5-3 1-1 3H9l-1-3-3-1-2-5 2-5 3-1 1-3Z\"></path></svg></span><span>화면 설정</span></button><div class=\"local-note\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>홈 미리보기</div></div>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"main-shell\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\">\n      <a class=\"mobile-brand\" href=\"mobile.html\" aria-label=\"SYNK WORLD 홈\"><img src=\"assets/logo.webp\" alt=\"synk\"><span>WORLD</span></a>\n      <div class=\"breadcrumb\">나의 월드 <span>/</span> <strong>홈</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"top-actions\"><span class=\"preview-label\">미리보기</span><button class=\"icon-button\" data-action=\"notifications\" aria-label=\"새 소식\"><span data-icon=\"bell\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0v5l-2 4h16l-2-4V8Zm-8 12h4\"></path></svg></span><i class=\"notification-dot\"></i></button><button class=\"profile-button\" data-action=\"profile\" aria-label=\"내 프로필\"><img src=\"assets/mongle-smile.webp\" alt=\"\"></button></div>\n    </header>\n    <main id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n      <div class=\"page-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">A LITTLE PLAY, A BIG WORLD</p><h1>오늘도, 나답게 놀아봐.</h1></div><span class=\"date-label\" id=\"today-label\">10월 9일 금요일</span></div>\n      <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\" data-time=\"day\">\n        <div class=\"hero-copy\"><div class=\"place-label\"><span data-icon=\"sun\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10Zm0-5v2m0 16v2M2 12h2m16 0h2M5 5l1.5 1.5m11 11L19 19M5 19l1.5-1.5m11-11L19 5\"></path></svg></span><span id=\"place-label\">햇살 좋은 나의 테라스</span></div><h2 id=\"hero-title\">작은 놀이가<br>나의 세상이 되는 곳.</h2><p>몽글과 놀고, 꾸미고,<br class=\"desktop-break\"> 한국어로 조금 더 가까워져요.</p><button class=\"felt-button\" data-action=\"quickplay\"><span data-icon=\"play\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7V5Z\"></path></svg></span>오늘의 놀이 시작<span data-icon=\"arrow\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></button><span class=\"hero-footnote\">가볍게 한 판, 90초부터</span></div>\n        <div id=\"home-scene\" class=\"home-scene scene-ready\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"팔 없는 몽글이 있는 입체 테라스. 캐릭터 인사와 차림은 아래 버튼으로 바꿀 수 있습니다.\"><img class=\"scene-fallback\" src=\"assets/mongle.webp\" alt=\"펠트 몽글\"><div class=\"scene-loading\" id=\"scene-loading\"><span></span>몽글이 준비하고 있어요</div><canvas data-engine=\"three.js r180\" class=\"world-scene-canvas\" aria-label=\"입체 테라스의 몽글. 좌우로 드래그하거나 방향키로 둘러보고, Enter 키로 인사할 수 있어요.\" tabindex=\"0\" width=\"350\" height=\"326\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; touch-action: pan-y; cursor: grab; outline-offset: -5px;\"></canvas></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-tools\"><div class=\"time-control\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"테라스 시간\"><button class=\"is-active\" data-time=\"day\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"낮으로 보기\"><span data-icon=\"sun\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10Zm0-5v2m0 16v2M2 12h2m16 0h2M5 5l1.5 1.5m11 11L19 19M5 19l1.5-1.5m11-11L19 5\"></path></svg></span></button><button data-time=\"sunset\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"노을로 보기\"><span data-icon=\"sunset\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M2 17h20M5 21h14M12 2v3M3 8l2 2m16-2-2 2\"></path></svg></span></button></div><button class=\"glass-button\" data-action=\"greet\" aria-label=\"몽글과 인사하기\"><span data-icon=\"sparkle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 2 2.5 7.5L22 12l-7.5 2.5L12 22l-2.5-7.5L2 12l7.5-2.5L12 2Z\"></path></svg></span><span>인사하기</span></button></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-caption\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span><span id=\"outfit-caption\">몽글 · 기본 차림</span><button data-action=\"wardrobe\">옷 갈아입기 <span data-icon=\"arrow\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></button></div>\n      </section>\n      <div class=\"content-grid\">\n        <section id=\"games-section\" class=\"games-section\" aria-labelledby=\"games-title\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PLAY &amp; LEARN</p><h2 id=\"games-title\">한 판만 해볼까?</h2></div><button class=\"text-button\" data-action=\"games\">모두 보기 <span data-icon=\"arrow\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></button></div>\n          <div class=\"game-grid\"><button class=\"game-card\" data-game=\"runner\"><div class=\"game-art runner-art\"><img src=\"assets/runner.jpg\" alt=\"바람길의 입체 달리기 코스\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"game-duration\">90초</span><span class=\"round-play\" data-icon=\"play\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7V5Z\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"game-info\"><span class=\"category-label\">듣고 움직이기</span><h3>바람길 <span data-icon=\"arrow\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></h3><p>짧은 부탁을 듣고, 길을 달려요.</p></div></button>\n          <button class=\"game-card\" data-game=\"rhythm\"><div class=\"game-art\"><img src=\"assets/rhythm.webp\" alt=\"펠트 리본과 빛으로 표현한 음악 콘텐츠 표지\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"game-duration\">리듬 · 듣기</span><span class=\"round-play\" data-icon=\"play\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7V5Z\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"game-info\"><span class=\"category-label\">음악과 한국어</span><h3>말의 리듬 <span data-icon=\"arrow\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></h3><p>박자를 타고, 듣고 O/X로 답해요.</p></div></button></div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"closet-card\" aria-labelledby=\"closet-title\"><div class=\"closet-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">MY WARDROBE</p><h2 id=\"closet-title\">오늘의 나를<br> 골라봐.</h2><p>작은 차림 하나로<br>달라지는 하루.</p><button class=\"text-button\" data-action=\"wardrobe\">옷장 열기 <span data-icon=\"arrow\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></button></div><img class=\"scarf-object\" src=\"assets/scarf.webp\" alt=\"음표 장식이 달린 하얀 펠트 목도리\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"item-tag\">포근한 목도리</span></section>\n        <section id=\"town-section\" class=\"town-card\" aria-labelledby=\"town-title\"><img src=\"assets/town.webp\" alt=\"미래 한국의 산과 도서관 광장\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"town-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">SYNK TOWN</p><h2 id=\"town-title\">한국어가 생활이 되는<br>우리 동네.</h2><p>내 집을 꾸미고, 이웃과 이야기를 나눠요.</p><button class=\"glass-button\" data-action=\"town\"><span data-icon=\"lock\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3M5 10h14v11H5V10Zm7 5v2\"></path></svg></span>싱크 타운 둘러보기<span data-icon=\"arrow\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></button><span class=\"town-condition\">TOPIK 1급+를 통과하면 열려요</span></div></section>\n        <section id=\"songs-section\" class=\"songs-card\" aria-labelledby=\"songs-title\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">SING ALONG</p><h2 id=\"songs-title\">입에 맴도는 한국어.</h2></div><span class=\"felt-note\" data-icon=\"music\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 18V5l11-2v13M9 8l11-2M9 18c0 2-2 3-4 3s-3-1-3-2 2-3 4-3 3 1 3 2Zm11-2c0 2-2 3-4 3s-3-1-3-2 2-3 4-3 3 1 3 2Z\"></path></svg></span></div><p class=\"song-intro\">짧은 노래로 글자와 소리를 친근하게.</p><div class=\"song-list\"><button class=\"song-row\" data-song=\"vowel-dance\"><span class=\"song-letter coral\">아</span><span><strong>모음 댄스</strong><small>모음 소리 · 55초</small></span><span class=\"song-play\" data-icon=\"play\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7V5Z\"></path></svg></span></button><button class=\"song-row\" data-song=\"geu-a-ga\"><span class=\"song-letter blue\">가</span><span><strong>그 아 가</strong><small>자음과 모음 · 1분 21초</small></span><span class=\"song-play\" data-icon=\"play\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7V5Z\"></path></svg></span></button><button class=\"song-row\" data-song=\"batchim\"><span class=\"song-letter butter\">안</span><span><strong>받침 노래</strong><small>받침 소리 · 1분 1초</small></span><span class=\"song-play\" data-icon=\"play\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 11 7-11 7V5Z\"></path></svg></span></button></div></section>\n      </div>\n      <footer class=\"page-footer\"><span>나만의 속도로, 나만의 세계를.</span><button class=\"text-button\" data-action=\"about\">미리보기 안내 <span data-icon=\"info\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 10v7m0-10h.01M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20Z\"></path></svg></span></button></footer>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n  <nav class=\"bottom-nav\" aria-label=\"휴대폰 주 메뉴\"><button data-nav=\"home\" class=\"\"><span data-icon=\"home\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10.5 12 3l9 7.5M5.5 9v11h5v-6h3v6h5V9\"></path></svg></span><span>홈</span></button><button data-nav=\"games\"><span data-icon=\"game\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10c2 0 3 2 3.5 4l1 6c.4 3-2 4-4 2l-2-2h-7l-2 2c-2 2-4.4 1-4-2l1-6C4 9 5 7 7 7ZM6 11v5m-2.5-2.5h5m7-2h.1m2 3h.1\"></path></svg></span><span>놀이</span></button><button data-nav=\"wardrobe\" class=\"is-active\" aria-current=\"page\"><span data-icon=\"hanger\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 6a2 2 0 1 1 4 0c0 2-2 2-2 4l9 6v3H3v-3l9-6\"></path></svg></span><span>옷장</span></button><button data-nav=\"town\"><span data-icon=\"town\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 21V9l6-4 6 4v12M6 11h1m4 0h1m-6 4h1m4 0h1m4-8 6 3v11H3m6-3v3m9-8h1m-1 4h1\"></path></svg></span><span>타운</span></button><button data-nav=\"songs\"><span data-icon=\"music\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 18V5l11-2v13M9 8l11-2M9 18c0 2-2 3-4 3s-3-1-3-2 2-3 4-3 3 1 3 2Zm11-2c0 2-2 3-4 3s-3-1-3-2 2-3 4-3 3 1 3 2Z\"></path></svg></span><span>노래</span></button></nav>\n</div>\n<dialog id=\"panel\" class=\"panel-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"panel-title\" open=\"\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"panel-eyebrow\">MY WARDROBE</p><h2 id=\"panel-title\">오늘은 어떤 차림?</h2></div><button class=\"icon-button dialog-close\" aria-label=\"닫기\"><span data-icon=\"close\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M6 18 18 6\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div id=\"panel-content\"><span class=\"preview-pill\">홈에서 입어보는 시연용 차림</span><p class=\"panel-description\">옷을 고르면 테라스의 몽글도 갈아입어요.</p><div class=\"outfit-options\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"차림 선택\"><button class=\"outfit-option\" data-outfit=\"none\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"outfit-tick\" data-icon=\"check\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"outfit-thumb\"><img src=\"assets/mongle.webp\" alt=\"\"></span><strong>기본 차림</strong><small>지금 입은 차림</small></button><button class=\"outfit-option\" data-outfit=\"scarf\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"outfit-tick\" data-icon=\"check\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"outfit-thumb\"><img src=\"assets/scarf.webp\" alt=\"\"></span><strong>포근한 목도리</strong><small>입어보기</small></button><button class=\"outfit-option\" data-outfit=\"apron\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"outfit-tick\" data-icon=\"check\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"outfit-thumb\"><span class=\"apron-mini\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span><strong>정원 앞치마</strong><small>입어보기</small></button></div><p class=\"dialog-note\">이 미리보기의 차림은 이 브라우저에 저장돼요. 실제 계정의 보유 아이템은 바뀌지 않아요.</p><div class=\"dialog-actions\"><button class=\"felt-button\" data-action=\"close\">이 차림으로 돌아가기<span data-icon=\"arrow\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></dialog>\n<div id=\"toast\" class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<audio id=\"song-audio\" preload=\"none\"></audio>\n\n</body>",
